description:
V24 · Panel as a checklist. Same as V22, but every row in the session's Customizations panel has an always-visible checkbox as its switch for this session; hidden hover switches are gone:
- sign-ins and errors get a real secondary button (Sign In, Show Output);
- section headers show "3 of 5 on";
- the footer becomes Discover and Manage buttons plus a Customize Panel action;
- right-click or the keyboard opens a row menu.
